Topi Linkala wrote:
> As long as you are able to bless and curse blank scrolls there is no
> need to wish for blessed or cursed markers. It's even counter productive
> to do so as blessed marker cannot write cursed scrolls and cursed marker
> cannot write blessed scrolls.

Good point about the inability to write opposite-curse-state scrolls
with a marker.  However, it is not true that there's no need for
blessed/cursed markers if you have a means of blessing or cursing
scrolls.  There is no means of blessing or cursing in the game that
does not deplete eventually, and I've had many games where I was in
danger of running out of holy water.  Indeed, it's one of the greater
problems in my games.

